    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "86B5CA9CF60274D5",
      "text": "Wie war dein Ausflug mit Jo und den anderen?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "7D7A79D5E660C5B4",
      "text": "Ein Kinderspiel!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "7D7A7CD5E660CACD",
      "text": "Ganz schön anstrengend!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "86B5C79CF6026FBC",
      "text": "Mit dir wird wohl jedes Abenteuer zu einem\\nSpaziergang, was?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_02b",
      "hash64": "E9520DB60624163A",
      "text": "Oh, bestimmt war es das! Aber am Ende habt ihr\\nes ja offenbar doch geschafft. Gut gemacht![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "86B5C89CF602716F",
      "text": "Ihr habt diesen riesigen Krater in Paldea\\nerkundet, hab ich recht?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "86B5C59CF6026C56",
      "text": "Ein bisschen fies ist es schon, dass du extra als\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,1210,0000)]AustauschschülerAustauschschülerin an unsere Akademie kommst,\\r\\nnur um dann gleich wieder nach Paldea geschickt\\r\\nzu werden...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1210",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 184,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "7D7A7BD5E660C91A",
      "text": "Hat mir nichts ausgemacht.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_04",
      "hash64": "7D7A76D5E660C09B",
      "text": "Jetzt, wo du es sagst...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "86B5C69CF6026E09",
      "text": "Sehr erwachsen von dir. Ich hätte mich an deiner\\nStelle schon längst beschwert...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "E94EE7B606219FD1",
      "text": "Ja, oder?! Das ist ein absolutes No-Go![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "86B5C39CF60268F0",
      "text": "Manche Leute können sich an unserer Akademie\\neinfach viel zu viele Freiheiten herausnehmen...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "86B5C49CF6026AA3",
      "text": "Deshalb müssen wir klipp und klar sagen,\\nwenn etwas absolut inakzeptabel ist![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "584CCB84E90DCCB5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hättest du zufällig einen Augenblick Zeit,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "584CCA84E90DCB02",
      "text": "Ich würde dir gerne berichten, was sich an den\\nRegeln der Liga-AG geändert hat, während du\\r\\nweg warst.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "584CC984E90DC94F",
      "text": "Zum Beispiel haben wir Veränderungen in den\\nRängen der Blaubeer-Liga fürs Erste auf Eis\\r\\ngelegt, um zusätzliches Chaos zu vermeiden.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "584CC884E90DC79C",
      "text": "Außerdem haben wir eine offizielle Regel\\neingeführt, die es auch Austauschschülern\\r\\ngestattet, den Rang des Champs einzunehmen![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "584CC784E90DC5E9",
      "text": "Des Weiteren haben wir AG-Regeln gelockert,\\ndie von Jo viel zu streng gemacht wurden.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "584CC684E90DC436",
      "text": "Und noch diese und jene andere Sache.\\nWie du siehst, waren wir ziemlich beschäftigt![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "0D491132F0304C51",
      "text": "Vielen Dank!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "0D490E32F0304738",
      "text": "Gute Arbeit!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "584CC584E90DC283",
      "text": "Oh, tut mir leid! Das klang jetzt sicher so,\\nals wollte ich unbedingt, dass du dich bei mir\\r\\nbedankst...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "584CC484E90DC0D0",
      "text": "Aber das musst du wirklich nicht, schließlich\\nhaben wir nur unsere Pflicht getan![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "584CD384E90DDA4D",
      "text": "Na ja, zumindest die meisten von uns...\\nLevy hat während der Meetings wie üblich\\r\\nGESCHLAFEN![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "584CD284E90DD89A",
      "text": "Jedenfalls war das alles, was ich von der\\nLiga-AG zu berichten habe![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "AFF8958C858C4FC4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Können wir kurz reden?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "AFF8968C858C5177",
      "text": "Als Jo noch Champ war, herrschte in der AG\\ndie meiste Zeit über dicke Luft...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "AFF8978C858C532A",
      "text": "Bestimmt gibt es einige Mitglieder, die sich\\ndeshalb von den Aktivitäten ferngehalten haben.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "AFF8988C858C54DD",
      "text": "Vielleicht würde es helfen, wenn sie erfahren,\\ndass unsere AG ein neues Motto hat?\\r\\nUnd du bist [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0E0E,0000)]derjenige, derdiejenige, die es bestimmen könnte![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0E0E",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "AFF8918C858C48F8",
      "text": "Fällt dir ein gutes Motto für die AG ein?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "30EE3D64CC124D0E",
      "text": "Mit Spaß und Fleiß zum Ziel!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
